# Workspace Agent Defaults

- Prefer small, focused changes unless asked for larger refactors.
- Explain tradeoffs briefly when multiple implementation options exist.
- Run relevant checks after edits and report results clearly.
- Keep docs and comments concise and actionable.
- Ask before destructive operations (deleting files, hard resets, force pushes).

# Trading Pulse

This repo is **Trading Pulse**. See root `AGENTS.md`.

| Task | Use |
|------|-----|
| Telegram / plans / guides / watchlist coding | `.cursor/skills/trading-pulse/SKILL.md` |
| «מה קרה היום?» / logs / fills | `trading-pulse-day-review` + `@trading-pulse-cracker` |
